# Remote Attestation over EDHOC (draft-ietf-lake-ra) service.
#
# Source files (ra-*.c) are collected automatically by Makefile.include's
# MODULES_SOURCES wildcard, so no explicit source list is needed here. The module
# is self-contained: no EDHOC / mbedTLS / c509 dependency. ra-edhoc-glue appraises
# raw EAD-value bytes; the application does the EDHOC-typed marshaling + handler
# registration. ra-binder pulls os/lib/sha-256 (a core lib, always available).
